---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import FieldScene from '../../components/FieldScene.astro';
---

<Base
  title="The Field · Brett Boggs"
  description="A prairie computed live by your GPU. Drag across it."
>
  <FieldScene tall>
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Lab</p>
      <h1>The Field</h1>
      <p class="lede">Wind over grass, computed live by your GPU. Drag across it.</p>
    </header>
  </FieldScene>

  <div class="colophon">
    <p>
      Every blade is its own spring, bent by a wind field that travels across the prairie. A
      compute shader integrates the whole field each frame; the pointer drags a gust through it.
      The blade count sizes itself to the device. Without WebGPU, or with reduced motion, the
      field stands still. The keepsake next door draws this same field, one frame at a time.
    </p>
  </div>

  <a class="back-link" href="/lab/">&larr; Lab</a>
</Base>
